! अनुस्वार (anusvaara) vs. म् (m)

If the word ending with अनुस्वार (anusvaara) is ''followed by a consonant'' or व्यञ्जनवर्ण (vyaJNjanavarNa) then अनुस्वार (anusvaara) remains as it is.

All other cases: use म्

If the word ending with अनुस्वार (anusvaara) is followed by a vowel or स्वरवर्ण (svaravarNa) then अनुस्वार (anusvaara) is substituted with letter म् (m).

If the sentence ends with a word which itself ends with अनुस्वार (anusvaara) then अनुस्वार (anusvaara) is substituted with letter म् (m).
